            "Portable runtime"
          ],
          "cons": [
            "Container support needed",
            "Deployment upkeep"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "chosen": {
        "label": "On-device edge inference",
        "value_id": "v:30.4"
      },
      "rationale": "On-device inference keeps inspection available during network outages and directly fits the cameras on the production lines. The design point is unattested in the workspace, so this is a brief-driven choice rather than a source-backed combination.",
      "consequences": [
        "Deploy model updates to line devices.",
        "Plan for device resource limits.",
        "Use local operation when disconnected."
      ]
    },
    {
      "decision": "How should weekly model updates be released?",
      "context": "Newly labelled images produce a retrained model every week, which must reach devices running offline. A failed update should not leave a line without a usable model.",
      "drivers": [
        "Weekly retraining",
        "Offline devices",
        "Small team"
      ],
      "alternatives": [
        {
          "label": "Progressive release automation with rollback",
          "value_id": "v:19.5",
